      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf forworht man friðstol gesece and þurh þæt feorh geyrne, þonne sy þreora an for his feore, bute man bet gearian wylle: wergyld, ece þeowet, hengenwitnuncg.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a condemned man seeks sanctuary and thereby saves his life, then unless greater mercy is shown, he is to receive one of three penalties in exchange for his life: wergild, perpetual enslavement, or punishment by hanging in bonds.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gyf forworht man friðstol gesece 7 þurh þæt feorh geyrne, þonne sy þreora án for his feore, bute man bet gearian wylle: wergyld, ece þeowet, hengenwitnuncg.</ab>
      </div>
